    "file": "mission-01.md",
    "lessonSummary": "Geschafft! Du hast eine vollständige Website gebaut – von der ersten Zeile bis zum Feinschliff. Herzlichen Glückwunsch!",
    "tasks": [
      {
        "instruction": "Baue deine vollständige Website mit allem aus der Liste oben.",
        "codeTemplate": "<!-- Deine Website, ab <!DOCTYPE html> -->\n",
        "solution": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"de\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Alles übers Skaten.\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>Skateboarden – Tricks und Parks</title>\n  <style>\n    nav {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 12px;\n    }\n    nav a:hover {\n      color: orangered;\n    }\n    .galerie {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(100px, 1fr));\n      gap: 8px;\n    }\n    .galerie img {\n      max-width: 100%;\n    }\n    body.dunkel {\n      background-color: #222;\n      color: white;\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 600px) {\n      nav {\n        flex-direction: column;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <header>\n    <h1>Skateboarden</h1>\n    <nav>\n      <a href=\"#start\">Start</a>\n      <a href=\"#galerie\">Galerie</a>\n      <a href=\"#kontakt\">Kontakt</a>\n    </nav>\n    <button id=\"modus\">🌙</button>\n  </header>\n  <main>\n    <section id=\"start\">\n      <h2>Start</h2>\n      <p>Alles übers Skaten.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section id=\"galerie\">\n      <h2>Galerie</h2>\n      <div class=\"galerie\">\n        <img src=\"/web-bilder/stern.svg\" alt=\"Ein Stern für den besten Trick\">\n        <img src=\"/web-bilder/baum.svg\" alt=\"Der Skatepark im Grünen\">\n        <img src=\"/web-bilder/rakete.svg\" alt=\"Ein Sprung wie eine Rakete\">\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section id=\"kontakt\">\n      <h2>Kontakt</h2>\n      <form>\n        <label for=\"mail\">E-Mail</label>\n        <input type=\"email\" id=\"mail\" name=\"mail\">\n        <button type=\"submit\">Senden</button>\n      </form>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n  <footer><p>© 2026 Jonas</p></footer>\n  <script>\n    document.querySelector('#modus').addEventListener('click', () => {\n      document.body.classList.toggle('dunkel');\n    });\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "validation": {
          "type": "web",
          "checks": [
